Lucraft: Core — Fabric 1.21.1 port
=================================

This project is a community port of Lucraft: Core by Lucraft/Nictogen
(https://gitlab.com/threetag/legacy/LucraftCore, originally for Minecraft
1.12.2 with Forge).

The original source is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Portions of the original code, assets, textures, language files and recipes
are used and/or adapted here under that license. See LICENSE.

Changes for this port: Minecraft 1.21.1 / Fabric APIs, registries, data
components, item groups, data-driven recipes/tags/loot/worldgen, status
effects, attachments, commands, menus and mixins.
